## Communication

- Response style: (concise | detailed)
- Approval style: (checkpoint each phase | batch at plan lock)

## Autonomy (Composer-style)

- **autonomy:** full | balanced | strict
  - **full** — auto capture, plan, compound, index; ask only on red risk + new agents
  - **balanced** — same; more Activity notifications (**default for metered GitHub Copilot credits**)
  - **strict** — legacy explicit approvals at capture/plan/implement

**GitHub Copilot credits:** Prefer `balanced` unless you keep a fresh codebase map (`harness snapshot` ≤30d). See `docs/onboarding/github-copilot-credit-efficiency.md`.

